{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\" data-listener-added_1c44408d=\"true\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1llw6ZfV\">感谢您选择巨量引擎开放平台Marketing API，本节将为您介绍<strong>开放平台的接入全流程</strong>，助您全方位实现自动化营销管理（营销投放、报表分析、创意素材及DMP人群的管理等）</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-MbT6345a\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Qqw0BFHu\">在调用Marketing API前，您必须先注册成为开发者、创建应用并申请对应接口权限。以下将分别为您介绍注册、创建应用、获取权限的具体流程。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3gb567oE\">请注意重点关注文档中加粗、标注部分的描述。&nbsp; &nbsp;</p></blockquote><h1 id=\"link-0\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-Y8G1KJRM\">1、如何注册成为开发者？</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-vikfFhg9\">在使用Marketing API接口功能前，需要您先注册成为开发者</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-2Xnhus8K\"><strong>Step1</strong>：进入注册页面，点击开放平台官网右上角【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/register.html?rid=erj3lme7sha\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">注册</a>】按钮即可进入&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-cGXWAtOK\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kY4YsRDw\"><strong>Tips：&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-Y3N2TI5M\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qqSdp4fl\"><strong>对于企业开发者，建议使用公司邮箱账户进行注册，并妥善管理，一个公司信息仅能注册认证一个开发者账户</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SWKcDA7O\">如果您已有巨量引擎账户，可选择左下角登陆，登陆对应账号</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-d05DArAj\"><strong>Step2</strong>：注册完成后会自动登陆进入巨量开放平台，点击开放平台官网右上角【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/developer/info.html?rid=dp10b9hd3e6\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">注册为开发者</a>】，继续完善填写信息并通过企业认证，即完成开发者注册。<br><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/331dbfbbb59e423797b9084eafc769c9~noop.image?x-expires=1988708620&amp;x-signature=ZzqFaszs1WjU3ZN65PcQR2qwZEA%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-QjI8eOyC\"><strong>Tips</strong>:</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-Vol9YHAq\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2lcsVomK\">填写您期望用于后续接收开放平台短信/邮件通知的手机号/邮箱信息，与注册开发者账号时填入的手机号/信息不需要保持一致</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mpvbdHl1\">该部分需完成企业信息填写，并完成企业打款认证</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-vsvo4mhs\"><strong>完成合同签订后，请在【</strong><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/account\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong>账号信息</strong></a><strong>】界面激活您的信息接收邮箱，并可添加新的联系人信息用于接收通知</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-aMyVGHi1\"><br></p><h1 id=\"link-1\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-ZRWoX1EU\">2、如何创建应用程序并申请权限</h1><h2 id=\"link-2\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-eKSeOq0M\">2.1 应用程序分类与作用</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-8q7DDOzN\">创建的应用程序是指基于Marketing API开发的应用，如管理营销的投放平台、数据分析工具、DMP人群自动化管理等。 创建应用程序后可申请开放的功能接口使用权限，对授权客户进行管理操作。 </p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ksvxFaXA\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-8Ht2UVY1\"><strong>Step1</strong>：认证通过成为开发者后，在开发者官网进行登陆并进入「APPID管理」页面，可选择创建的应用类型</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-mhKI1Uff\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/9d4f092cf0974e7185533203ad2f9b5a~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2054784330&amp;x-signature=Oak1R3VUlOiIqmM9IeHrUOfXpBo%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-UfDDkc72\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/4bf43bba73c44bc693675bc11f15e174~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2054784340&amp;x-signature=z%2B5yaTaOu0XS01e%2BOFK%2B3fjUwAg%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-HxJbNxHq\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-J74WROro\"><strong>Step2</strong>：确定应用类型后，进入创建应用程序界面，填写应用名称、图标、申请权限等。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-rcrAzowG\"><br></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-5NJaN102\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KuejGPzX\">应用名称：应用程序的名称（2-50个字符）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eJd1zbsM\">应用图标：推荐尺寸72*72，要求同比例尺寸、大小1M以内，格式支持jpg、png</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yF5apWU4\">回调地址：用户自定义的链接地址，用户同意完成授权后，Marketing API会将授权相关信息和status拼接至该回调地址</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-apmUt633\">申请权限：请结合自身开发诉求选择需要的权限，可以提前考虑长期的对接目标，一次申请相应功能权限</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-CmvDzDGN\"><strong>Step3</strong>：填写确认提交后，将在一个工作日内审核完成您的应用创建（APPID）申请</p><h1 id=\"link-4\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-DlX2KNdR\">3、发起请求</h1><h2 id=\"link-5\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-P7n1L2Mc\">3.1 申请客户授权</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-0KF0qC4P\">拥有开发者应用程序后，需要申请客户授权并获取AccessToken后，才可以通过接口对客户进行管理操作。系统会在校验Access_Token有效、接口调用频次未超限2个条件符合后接受此次请求进行具体业务处理并做出响应。Token、代理商/旧版巨量引擎工作台账户、User等相关关系如下图：<br><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/441a5d6a66ed47dda2cb064614904427~noop.image?x-expires=1988708620&amp;x-signature=zn0rtlWfMo3w2F6HcRSWEvwQeAw%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"><br>如图所示，虚线标识为已完成授权的账户（代理商账户1、代理商账户2），此时获得的Token可以同时操作客户1、客户2、客户3，<strong>即同一个User下的已授权账户共用同一个Token</strong>。以下将介绍申请客户授权的流程：&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-29XrBXpW\"><strong>Step1</strong>：在「APPID管理」页面选择要使用的应用程序，点击进入基本信息页面即可查看到授权URL，该页面展示的为默认申请所有权限的示例，可直接使用或自定义拼装，相关参数介绍如下：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-MWlF6CP8\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-88WnYbRT\">appid：申请客户授权的应用程序ID（APPID）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HlVuPOBm\">state：自定义参数，可用于传递自定义信息，回调时会原样带回。例如：可将客户账号作为自定义参数拼接授权URL并发送给对应客户申请授权，回调时以区分授权码对应的客户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ayu20gXK\">scope：即授权范围，授权的权限范围，不传时代表当前应用拥有的所有权限，权限值对应说明可参考「Scope权限说明」</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Xnhp3dwD\">redirect_uri：即回调链接，由开发者自行提供和定义，需与APPID设置的回调链接一致，用于授权成功跳转并接受回调信息。</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-Mcir6IFE\"><strong>Step2</strong>：将拼接完的授权URL发送给客户，引导客户访问授权URL登陆User账户完成授权。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-VN7SQNRS\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MYeNzPRd\"><strong>Step3</strong>：客户勾选授权账户并点击「同意授权」，页面将跳转到回调地址并带上auth_code和 state参数<br>页面如下图：<br><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/6592f0d44ad44e7299fb8b13fd6837a1~noop.image?x-expires=1988708621&amp;x-signature=g9rF6mlmnRDeFDQgF9Jat52um8U%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"><br><strong>Tips</strong>：</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-5kZlUaY7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YWnsKorU\"><strong>auth_code有效期只有10分钟，且只能使用一次，过期或者多次使用都会报错</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WcfwzCqS\">授权回调链接需要与APPID设置的回调链接一致，否则访问会报错</li></ol><h2 id=\"link-6\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-K8pVrbD1\">3.2 应用程序获取调用权限</h2><h3 id=\"link-7\" data-id=\"h6f20189-F8XWEWK2\">3.2.1 如何获取Access_Token</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-aVtsvP9E\">获取到客户授权返回的auth_code后，可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取Access Token</a>】接口获取授权客户对应的AccessToken和RefreshToken</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-DBPUvwUV\">接口请求地址：<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/oauth2/access_token/\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/oauth2/access_token/</span></a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5MmqS4Jt\">请求参数如下：</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-id=\"t29i68u4g-105jmqii52hs000\" data-custom=\"false\" class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-uow92p8ko5s000\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c1uwdizgg-1cwcnx82g4gw000\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c1uwdizgg-om5esv1xubk000\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c1uwdizgg-ueyepjbisa8000\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-zxyvp8bomqo000\"><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1d5tskzvvyxs000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-1h4ok9jfcluo000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-13qa4jk337k0000\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-16irb6w9pw2o000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-166nz0910jz4000\">类型</p></td><td data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-1d22k3k7xajk000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-uomdjgouks0000\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-197r4wx8lf34000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tiq5bzl28-dv20qamnlz4000\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2fowup0o9mtc00\">app_id&nbsp;<span data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22hDO2P%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" class=\" qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tiq5bzl28-l47yr0fjqnk000\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-xl1muvtdk8w000\">number</p></td><td data-id=\"t4hr9fnia-mol9kreetkw000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1e5lkr5bvrq8000\">开发者申请的应用APP_ID，可通过应用管理界面查看</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-pw8podz5ha8000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tiq5bzl28-ajuxo0zc0o0000\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-r4fmwtzq37k000\">secret&nbsp;<span data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22p3iWw%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" class=\" qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tiq5bzl28-r61dlkowt40000\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1by7dvsvuops000\">string</p></td><td data-id=\"t4hr9fnia-18ec1hvwnrls000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2uj0pq6ytb6000\">开发者应用的私钥Secret，可通过应用管理界面查看，<span style=\"color: #f24408;\">确保填入</span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">secret</span></code><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">与</span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">app_id</span></code><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">对应以免报错</span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-m0w2avon3lc000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t33hpnutm-116tcvl2dpa8000\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-fvkj6yfop40000\">auth_code&nbsp;<span data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%223jkUQ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" class=\" qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t33hpnutm-1m7ugmq8lf9c000\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-zqxvunnvnn4000\">string</p></td><td data-id=\"t33hpvojc-m746w6njptc000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1f36ceu02buo000\">授权码，在授权完成后回调时会提供该授权码，只有10分钟有效期，且只能使用一次<span style=\"color: #f24408;\">确保填入</span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">auth_code</span></code><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">与</span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">app_id</span></code><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">对应以免报错</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-N3LqmHJi\">请求示例：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22curl%20--location%20--request%20POST%20'https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2Foauth2%2Faccess_token%2F'%20%5C%5C%5Cn--header%20'Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson'%20%5C%5C%5Cn--data-raw%20'%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22app_id%5C%22%3A123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22secret%5C%22%3A%5C%22xxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22auth_code%5C%22%3A%5C%22xxxx%5C%22%5Cn%7D'%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RmI3z%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-xCkZZoKy\">返回示例：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22code%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22message%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22data%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22access_token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22refresh_token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%22%3A%201%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22advertiser_ids%5C%22%3A%20%5B1%2C2%2C3%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22expires_in%5C%22%3A%2086400%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22refresh_token_expires_in%5C%22%3A%20604800%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gEdhi%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-uAcMCpim\">获取到AccessToken之后，就可以使用AccessToken调用相关功能接口对客户进行管理操作了。 但是请注意，<strong>一旦Access_Token失效后，将无法继续调用接口操作</strong>，需要刷新获取新的AccessToken才可以继续进行相关调用操作。 Access_Token与Refresh_Token的有效期如下：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-QDb6YR44\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5257oMwJ\">Access_Token有效期为<strong>24小时</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-A28CaG6j\">Refresh_Token有效期为<strong>30天</strong></li></ul><h3 id=\"link-8\" data-id=\"h6f20189-OkFLAC18\">3.2.2 如何刷新Access_Token</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-Wxxjdf1G\">Refresh_Token在有效期内，可以通过接口【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1696710506097679?origin=left_nav\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">刷新Refresh Token</a>】刷新Access_Token。 请求示例：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22curl%20--location%20--request%20POST%20'https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2Foauth2%2Frefresh_token%2F'%20%5C%5C%5Cn--header%20'Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson'%20%5C%5C%5Cn--data-raw%20'%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22app_id%5C%22%3A123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22secret%5C%22%3A%5C%22xxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22grant_type%5C%22%3A%5C%22refresh_token%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22refresh_token%5C%22%3A%5C%22xxxx%5C%22%5Cn%7D'%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o0aTa%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-mFhBFRfr\"><strong>Tips</strong>:</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-cXaSYHN9\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qitAxNXc\">刷新Access_Token会同时获得新的Access_Token和Refresh_Token，并且<strong>有效期都会重置</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-m0AlykBC\">刷新成功后原Refresh_Token将不能再继续使用，<strong>再次刷新需要使用上次刷新获得的新的Refresh_Token</strong>，一旦丢失则需要申请客户授权重新获取，所以请妥善保管</li></ol></div>",
